      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `c906fae1513f73143c378541fb60c248364fb2d06a814e62f38a6ac3f8e228ed--prisoners-australia-2018-cube-1-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Prisoners in Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2018\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 15 of 15\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 109e7715ae6a0153c0a3def7a1d711fa46d9246534c9e4ad3d50595751e98e0f | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 54da20e5465dcc5c0f10ed4bbe86c03a697d5072d33b7223cc6fc9a738b74b9c | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 8e23bc48cb26e45e4c7ad49298d5f29d35be8cb2d3b1a7c7cd54a7d4d240c660 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 72cdae47caba7ecb17d12511d7fe5e49de6fba1b88aa967b59832a95ed29dc00 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | a270fbffe6d380f2e92e2c3418d39417b7dbe621d4b093fdfb772db6e5562de3 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 47f153ed1ef5520167e88421f5f717d1223363880838dec2ab1920ec402b9e5c | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 8cda702b77caa4e8185923c05cae630fb9483c523e928a31fae49c70716af37f | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | a7419fcbd4a8b675dfd18b8d03cb7b94de8f1e48c14bc5a9c890f1d22cb44fa7 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 3cc0953878029ef177acc5f53d21791c4e0fea297fa71c3fce578df5e8016b9a | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 3efad652aae1b8b0d85b3a9c6089d190078a636f0319bf95a6dfe5d6fea9c3a1 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | de05abe6b3bf46a1adb379575e94ad69798ab44d8ba0325fc40c2028564495ef | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 99b302ff555f1a22fa7474cc926b2d830d2a6c9e3c41d8d7ee1cb98ecabff8aa | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | dd52153cce163a5151250861db91957b72de28ed2fdf85e46410b1700d416231 | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | 0cf73164e56c7424dd4063b616dcc7395ff5313ef0df1c42d631643a86b2f50e | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 0b69167558f1a6c441a48542eb6a57ac22f05f81a2833320abc3707737640025 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
